“Stayin’ Fly” — Disco-Funk Song for the Bird Crew

MUSIC GENRE & FEEL
70’s Disco-Funk with a Disco–style falsetto lead.
Bright hi-hats, four-on-the-floor kick, funky clavinet, wah-wah rhythm guitar, shimmering string stabs, playful bird-chirp harmonies.
Tempo: 104–108 BPM (classic disco swagger).
Mood: confident, funky, glam, strutting, fabulous.
Instrumentation includes: bass guitar slides, glittery electric piano, disco strings, tiny “chirp-falsettos,” vinyl crackle for warmth.

